        "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"moribayashi366\"} -->\n_Requested by **すみす**_\n\nBefore: The header showed a plain house icon with typed text, a person's status opened as a large modal, the status panel beside the map could not be enlarged, and KPI notes used developer terms (\"状態境界\", \"WorldState\").\n\nAfter: The header top-left shows the supplied logo (house and 避難所IF！ only). Clicking a person opens a small scrollable speech bubble next to the click, and the evacuee/staff panel can be expanded in the page with a \"⤢ 大きく表示\" button. KPI notes are written in plain language.\n\nHow: Front-end changes in `demo-v2.html/js/css`; the logo is served as `/demo-v2-logo.jpg` via one new route in `web/server.py` and included in package data in `pyproject.toml`. No simulation, API or schema changes. `tests/test_demo_v2.py` passes offline (12 tests). This follows the already merged #41; only the one new commit is in this PR.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
